WEBVTT

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:10.840
Now, then. You're here
today to be Appraised.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.590
Right.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:19.220
Appraisal magic requires the
target's conscious consent,

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:24.060
so do try to relax and allow
the spell to complete.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.150
I'll try my best.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.480
Very well. Let's begin.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:17.220
Why the long face? Are you that upset
about going to be Appraised?

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.350
Ever since that day in the hospital,

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:24.600
every person in every
corner of the Kingdom...

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.100
...has been saying I'm the Saint.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:33.650
The only reason Aira-<i>chan </i>and
I haven't been Appraised yet

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:38.110
is because the only person who <i>could</i>
Appraise us, the Grand Magus,

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.700
fell into a coma after the
Saint-summoning ritual.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.910
And now that he's woken up...

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:52.880
If he appraises me, and they <i>do </i>say
I'm the Saint... what happens then?

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.590
I mean, you must have known this would
happen after the stunt you pulled.

00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:01.340
<i>What </i>stunt? Some people were hurt,
so I healed them a little, that's all.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:08.140
That was <i>hardly </i>a little, and you know it.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:21.700
Reports say the monster population has
steadily decreased since the Summoning.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:26.120
Which means that the Saint was,
indeed, Summoned.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.410
In the past, the Saint would go with
the Knightly Orders on expeditions,

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:35.590
assisting as only She could to
eradicate the land of monsters.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:39.550
It's safe to believe the Kingdom expects
the same duties of the current Saint.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:44.050
Does that mean I'd have to go into battle?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.470
I've never been anywhere
near a battle before.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:51.520
The world I came from was peaceful.
I don't know if I <i>could </i>fight.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.860
I'm sure they wouldn't have you fight
until you'd completed some training.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.480
Apparently, the other woman
summoned alongside you, Aira,

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.650
has been doing just that at the Academy.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.820
She has?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:15.830
So, uh... what happens if they
appraise me, and I'm <i>not </i>the Saint?

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:22.470
Then Aira will likely take on
all of the Saint's duties.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.680
However...

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:29.010
They may ask you to join
them in a support role,

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:32.680
seeing as mages who can cast healing
magic are few and far between.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:38.770
If I agree to help, does that mean I'll
have to move to the Royal Magi Assembly?

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.360
I'm not sure.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.240
I'd...

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.490
I'd like to stay at
the Institute, if I can.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.910
I can understand. I'll see what I can do.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.090
Appraisal

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:10.100
--Look, there she is.
--Is that the Saint?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:11.720
So that's <i>her</i>...

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.190
Director Valdec of the
Medicinal Flora Research Institute

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.230
and Lady Sei are here to see you.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:31.740
Welcome to the Royal Magi Assembly.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:36.620
I am Grand Magus Yuri Drewes.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.880
P-Pleased to meet you, I'm Sei.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.420
<i>This </i>is the Grand Magus?

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:45.800
He looks like he stepped
out of a painting!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.430
Hold on a sec...

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:50.850
How did I get surrounded
by gorgeous guys?!

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:56.190
I believe you're acquainted with Magus
Erhart Hawke, our second-in-command.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.850
Th-That's right.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.770
I knew he had to be important,

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:03.280
but I didn't know he
was that high-ranking.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.320
Wait, <i>Hawke</i>?

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:08.200
He's Al's big brother.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.410
Huh?!

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:16.410
Now, then. You're here
today to be Appraised.

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.620
Right.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.750
Appraisal magic requires the
target's conscious consent,

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.220
so do try to relax and
allow the spell to complete.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.550
I'll try my best.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.970
Very well. Let's begin.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.690
<i>Appraise</i>.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.870
Oh, no, does this mean...

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.280
Sei!

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.240
I didn't do anything!

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.250
Really?

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.540
Really, I swear!

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.420
I take it that you didn't purposefully
resist the Appraisal spell?

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.130
No, I didn't.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:08.050
Is that right? Then that
can mean only one thing.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:11.720
Your magic power is greater than mine.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:14.390
Greater than the Grand Magus?!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.850
Since when were you this powerful, Sei?

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:23.270
There's no point in trying, then.
That will be all for the Appraisal.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.780
Are you sure?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:27.940
It's quite all right.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.440
But, Ser!

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:35.330
Instead, might I ask you to
show me how you cast spells?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.540
Sure, I can do that.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.660
Then please use <i>Heal</i>.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:43.380
Wait, just <i>H-Heal</i>?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.670
Yes, please.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:48.840
That's such a simple spell.
Will that really help him?

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:56.720
<i>Heal</i>.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.350
My word!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.100
I see.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.940
Please, observe.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:08.190
<i>Heal</i>.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.740
Did you notice the difference?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:19.080
Typical mages, including myself,
only produce a white light.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:25.330
But your <i>Heal </i>spell produces
those golden sparkles as well.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:30.630
The knights you healed at the hospital
also reported the same effect.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.880
As such, I wished to see it for myself.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:37.300
Thank you for cooperating
with my requests today.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.030
Ser?

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:01.250
Do you know what those sparkles even are?

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.210
Unfortunately, no, not yet.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.290
They may be a result of
your otherworldly origins,

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.750
or something <i>else </i>entirely.

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:15.510
I'm pretty sure I have a
good idea why that is.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:19.180
It's the same reason for everything
that's happened to me since I got here--

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:25.810
and for the curse that makes everything
I do 1.5 times more powerful.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:32.320
All the things I've done have been a
surprise to everyone around me.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.190
When I think back on each and every one,

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.490
it was all tied to the
magic power I possess.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:41.160
That, and the strange gold sparkles
that only appear when I cast spells.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:53.340
I am the Grand Magus of the
Royal Magi Assembly, Yuri Drewes.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:56.340
I've come to deliver a report.

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:59.640
Good. My apologies, but I wish
to speak with him alone.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.560
Of course. I'll take my leave, then.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:06.060
I assume this is about the Saint?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:10.270
Indeed. I performed her
Appraisal today, as planned.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:17.070
Your spell was unable to
affect her, Grand Magus?

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.620
You're sure she didn't resist the spell?

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.370
I am. That was not why it failed.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.910
Then how?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:29.420
It must be because her magic
power far surpasses my own.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:33.750
That's preposterous! You are the most
powerful mage in the entire kingdom!

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:34.800
That can't be true!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.420
Surprisingly, it <i>is</i>.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:41.600
You were able to measure Lady Aira's
potential without trouble, yes?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.600
Correct. You can read
the results in that report.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.940
Her quick improvement in all manner
of skills is most remarkable.

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.230
Agreed.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.320
As we cannot properly Appraise Lady Sei,
we're left with only these facts:

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.150
Lady Sei is blessed with an
incalculable amount of magic power,

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:03.950
while Lady Aira possesses the unnatural
ability to rapidly improve her skills.

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:07.200
So you're saying we still don't
have enough information, then?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:11.290
We don't know which one
of them is the Saint?

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.540
Not quite.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.000
Hm?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.130
I believe Lady Sei is the Saint.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:23.600
I once thought that the golden sparkles
that appear when Lady Sei casts magic

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:27.890
were due to her being from another world.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:33.770
However, when Lady Aira casts magic,
those sparkles do not appear.

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:38.780
I believe the phenomenon must
then be a facet of her Sainthood.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:44.780
Furthermore, Lady Sei's spells are far
more potent than a normal mage's--

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:48.290
and more potent than Lady Aira's.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:53.380
Excellent work. You may go.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.130
I will continue with my
research on this matter.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:02.550
Well, this makes matters
all the more complicated.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:07.140
If things go poorly, this could
result in a crisis of succession.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.430
Kyle shows no sign of stopping, then?

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.230
Indeed, that appears to be the case.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:17.690
His impropriety at the Summoning
and insulting behavior towards Sei

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.820
can no longer be overlooked or ignored.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.910
We must formally invite Sei to
court as our honored guest.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.450
Make the necessary preparations at once.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:38.880
An audience with His Majesty the King?!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.630
But Ser...

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.380
What is it?

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:46.010
I don't have anything fancy
enough to wear to court.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:49.310
That's quite all right.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:52.390
We'll take care of
everything you may need.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:55.350
A-And I don't know
how to conduct myself...

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:58.650
His Majesty will not be bothered
by that in the slightest.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:01.610
Would you do him the
honor of your presence?

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:05.240
I have to be firm, or he'll keep asking.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:08.280
But if I turn him down,

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:12.960
he might think I'm still mad
at him about the Summoning...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:16.710
And turning him down could put the
Director in an uncomfortable position.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.050
Very well.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:24.680
Excellent. We will come to collect
you on the aforementioned day.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:34.390
Lady Sei, we will have you prepare
for your court visit here.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:40.230
Welcome back! We've missed you dearly.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.940
Miss Marie!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:44.320
I've been informed of your situation.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:47.570
Please, leave everything to us.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:48.780
Huh?

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:54.960
First, let us take care of
your current clothing.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:58.460
I-I can undress myself!

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:13.470
Lady Sei.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:20.060
Whoa, who the heck is <i>this</i>?

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:22.980
Lady Sei,

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.280
here are your garments
for today's visit to court.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.410
Oh, geez...

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:37.750
The Grand Magus supposedly
failed to Appraise me,

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:41.840
but if they're making me wear <i>this</i>,

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:45.380
then they must be pretty
sure I'm the Saint...

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.470
There you are.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:02.230
You look beautiful!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.690
Thank you.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.530
Lady Sei,

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:11.740
you have a visitor.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.080
I do?

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.880
Commander Hawke!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.880
Good morning, Sei.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.380
Good morning, Commander.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.930
So, uh... what brings you here?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:31.930
I'm here as your personal bodyguard.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.550
Huh?

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:36.270
I'll be escorting you to
His Majesty's court.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:39.100
But that's just down the hall!

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:43.980
I thought you might be lonely by yourself.
Should I not have come?

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.400
Oh, no, I don't mind at all!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:47.530
Good.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.740
Johan was worried that
you might be nervous

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:52.780
before your first audience with the King.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.200
That's kind of him.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.160
Thank you both.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.170
Is everything all right?

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.420
Oh, yes.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.880
You look a bit different,
but you're as lovely as always.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.970
Sei...

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.360
I'm so embarrassed!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:44.880
Still, I'm glad the Commander
is here with me.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:25.960
I knew that smile was his way of
saying everything would be okay.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:55.400
I am Siegfried Salutania,
ruler of this great Kingdom.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.070
I'm Sei Takanashi.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.540
First, I must apologize to you for
Summoning you so suddenly,

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:05.460
and for son's uncouth behavior.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:19.760
When they summoned me, then ignored me
entirely and told me I couldn't go home,

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:23.520
I was so incredibly angry.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:27.310
But I've decided to stay in this world.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.060
I fell in love with my
work at the Institute,

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:34.400
and everyone around me is so wonderful.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:39.200
I haven't completely forgotten
that anger I felt in the beginning,

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:42.780
but living in this world feels so right...

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.370
Please, rise.

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:55.170
We are humbled by your good grace.

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:02.720
Since your arrival, you have performed
many meritorious deeds for our people.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:06.350
An apology is not enough;
I am compelled to reward you.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.600
What is it you desire?

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:12.440
It could be a court title,
land, anything you like.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.740
Nothing in particular.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:29.920
I have to ask for <i>something</i>,
or I'll never hear the end of this.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.130
What <i>do </i>I want, though?

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:39.550
My research into making
higher-grade potions is still stalled,

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.300
so if I could find the right knowledge...

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.100
Perhaps in a book?

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:48.640
I'm sure you'd find tomes with that
knowledge in the Forbidden Collection!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.730
May I ask, then,

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.770
to be allowed access to the
library's Forbidden Collection?

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.070
I have one more request.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:03.200
I would like to learn more about magic.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.620
Would it be possible for
you to find me a teacher?

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:10.460
I can use some magic now,

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:13.880
but there is only so much
I can learn from books.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:16.630
I would like an opportunity
to formally learn spellcasting.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:21.010
Very well. Consider it done.

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.590
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:44.820
Your Highness.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.290
My father did <i>what</i>?

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:55.500
He apologized to her formally in court.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.630
What is that man thinking?!

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:03.550
Then has my father has acknowledged
the other woman as the Saint?!

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:07.010
No, he did not explicitly say so in court.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:08.720
Good.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:14.060
Still, many in the Palace are whispering
about her being the true Saint.

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.440
Let them whisper.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:19.440
When the time is upon them,
they will see that I am right,

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.280
as Aira's deeds will prove it!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.110
No need to fret!

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.410
We will stay the course until
the right chance is upon us!

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:31.120
For <i>we </i>have the Saint!

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:17.850
Good morning!

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:20.520
Huh?

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:23.230
Let us begin with our lesson.

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:28.280
Wait, <i>you're </i>going to teach me magic,
Grand Magus Drewes?!

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:29.360
Indeed!

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.540
Yuri Drewes, personal magic tutor,
at your service.

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.020
Lady
